&lt;p&gt;Barbara Davies, known to all as Barb, was a very long time mainstay of the Divine Love movement in Vancouver and a mentor to the medium, Al Fike for most of his life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Barb first mentored Al as a 22 year old. Barb began hosting Divine Love prayer circles in her West Vancouver home probably in the late 1970’s or early 1980’s which carried on until 2020 when that home was sold after her passing, but her spirit lives on through Terry Adler who continues to host these prayer sessions.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Bernice Fike</title><link>https://elcaminodelaverdad.es/6-es-cont-mess/6-3-es-dep-friends/6-3-5-es-fike-bernice/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Feb 2024 02:18:11 +1100</pubDate><guid>https://elcaminodelaverdad.es/6-es-cont-mess/6-3-es-dep-friends/6-3-5-es-fike-bernice/</guid><description>&lt;h4 id="bernice-fike"&gt;Bernice Fike&lt;/h4&gt;
