&lt;p&gt;Lorna passed away on October 19th, 2016. Her first communication was November 13th, 2016. So she took a few years to reach the Fifth, which is the first “uniquely” Divine Love sphere and solid evidence of her progression in the teachings that came through James Padgett from Jesus himself. This is a pretty reasonable rate of progression, but there is of course no particular race, even as some folks certainly have made a huge effort to reach the Celestial.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Percy Hayes</title><link>https://elcaminodelaverdad.es/6-es-cont-mess/6-3-es-dep-friends/6-3-10-es-hayes-percy/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Feb 2024 02:18:11 +1100</pubDate><guid>https://elcaminodelaverdad.es/6-es-cont-mess/6-3-es-dep-friends/6-3-10-es-hayes-percy/</guid><description>&lt;h4 id="percy-hayes"&gt;Percy Hayes&lt;/h4&gt;
